[{"id":"demo-http-success","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"HTTP 基础","tags":["状态码","成功响应"],"articleKey":"flashcard-demo/index.md","articleTitle":"闪卡插件效果预览","articlePath":"flashcard-demo/index.html","articles":[{"articleKey":"flashcard-demo/index.md","articleTitle":"闪卡插件效果预览","articlePath":"flashcard-demo/index.html"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>哪个 HTTP 状态码通常表示请求成功？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>200 OK\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>200 OK\u003c/code> 表示请求成功。响应内容取决于请求方法，例如 \u003ccode>GET\u003c/code> 通常返回资源，\u003ccode>POST\u003c/code> 通常返回操作结果。\u003c/p>\n\u003ch3 id=\"参考资料\">\u003ca href=\"#参考资料\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"参考资料\">\u003c/a>参考资料\u003c/h3>\u003cul>\n\u003cli>\u003ca href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Status/200\">MDN：200 OK\u003c/a>\u003c/li>\n\u003c/ul>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["A"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>200\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>404\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>500\u003c/p>\n"}]}]